# BARE — Bamep Agent Runtime Environment
#
# This BR2_EXTERNAL tree owns Bamep's minimal bootable Agent-hosting runtime.
# BARE V1 (Issue #72) is BusyBox + a kernel config fragment + a rootfs-overlay
# startup hook; it deliberately has NO BR2_EXTERNAL packages.
#
# A future Work Package that adds the Bamep Agent (a separate executable BARE
# hosts) will add its package menu here. Do not add packages speculatively.
